      "sourceId": "xvfc-main-report",
      "notes": "Horizontal shares are fixed for the whole award period, so they apply to every year from 2021-22 to 2025-26. They are cited to the Commission's own report, which is where they are decided — Table 6.5, 28 states summing to exactly 100. This used to cite the Ministry of Finance's restatement in the Receipts Budget 2025-26, Annex-4, chosen because its text layer rendered all 28 rows where the 2022-23 and 2024-25 editions corrupt the Madhya Pradesh and Maharashtra rows. That was an extraction convenience standing in for a provenance claim, and it made four actual-final years cite a budget-estimate document from a year none of them are: the shares were right, the citation was not. Annex-4 remains a useful cross-check — the 2022-23 and 2024-25 editions agree with Table 6.5 exactly — but the award is the source.",
